    "title": "Weaver, DeAngelo guide Riverside to shutout over Pennsauken Tech - Baseball recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Advance Local Express Desk ,\n1 days ago Andrew Weaver struck out nine batters in three shutout innings and drove in one run as Riverside defeated Pennsauken Tech 17-0 in Riverside. The game ended after five innings with Riverside (2-2) scoring 12 runs in the first inning and adding four more in the fourth. Pennsauken Tech (0-5) managed just two hits and committed four errors. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
